ster.avif?t=1755285028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560040/extras/3d3841c7d135dbd705edf72e47842b8b.webm?t=1755285028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560040/extras/3d3841c7d135dbd705edf72e47842b8b.mp4?t=1755285028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f HERO'S PATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return with your loot or continue your journey for greater rewards, risking everything. After each day of adventure, make a decision \u2014 end your quest or test fate by venturing deeper into the fairy-tale world, where dangers and rewards become increasingly significant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who Our Game Is For</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of card roguelikes and tactical games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enthusiasts of Slavic mythology and fairy tales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who value strategic depth and tactical variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone seeking a unique gaming experience with numerous discoveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560040/extras/bbe73212292f8a9e5f9462c8314510b4.poster.avif?t=1755285028\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560040/extras/bbe73212292f8a9e5f9462c8314510b4.webm?t=1755285028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560040/extras/bbe73212292f8a9e5f9462c8314510b4.mp4?t=1755285028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off on a journey through a fairy-tale world and become a hero of legends!</p>",
